WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.521
- Dwelling on what you (beep) up on

00:00:02.521 --> 00:00:04.705
is the quickest way for
the next thing not to work.

00:00:04.705 --> 00:00:06.587
All great stuff, especially
when you're innovating

