00:05:21.872 --> 00:05:23.508
InSolar App, you can buy stuff.

00:05:23.508 --> 00:05:24.708
Subscription for reviews.

00:05:24.708 --> 00:05:25.701
It was a lot of fun.

00:05:25.701 --> 00:05:27.263
Only did it for five months, stopped it

00:05:27.263 --> 00:05:29.193
