00:05:29.193 --> 00:05:33.208
It's always hard to know when
to jump off something new.

00:05:33.208 --> 00:05:34.876
But I find that people

00:05:34.876 --> 00:05:36.377
don't believe in what they're doing.

00:05:36.377 --> 00:05:38.403
They hear a guru

00:05:38.403 --> 00:05:40.588
