00:05:43.044 --> 00:05:43.877
"So let me do it."

00:05:43.877 --> 00:05:45.582
But they don't believe it.

00:05:45.582 --> 00:05:47.420
And so then they jump,
they're looking for no's

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:48.253
