00:05:48.253 --> 00:05:49.980
Everything I do, every
business development

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:51.953
every event I do, every time I try

00:05:51.953 --> 00:05:53.729
a new marketing tactic or sales tactic

00:05:53.729 --> 00:05:54.914
I'm looking for the yes.

00:05:54.914 --> 00:05:55.747
- Right.

00:05:55.747 --> 00:05:56.654
- I'm looking for the yes

00:05:56.654 --> 00:05:58.663
and if the no punches me

00:05:58.663 --> 00:06:00.886
