"Crap, the no punched me."

00:06:00.886 --> 00:06:02.107
I believe the majority of people

00:06:02.107 --> 00:06:03.101
when they try new tactics

00:06:03.101 --> 00:06:05.234
are looking for the no

00:06:05.234 --> 00:06:06.221
and you're going to be getting a lot

00:06:06.221 --> 00:06:07.819
of subtle no's immediately.

00:06:07.819 --> 00:06:08.652
- [Host] Right.

00:06:08.652 --> 00:06:10.574
- And so I think that's why that happens.

00:06:10.574 --> 00:06:11.969
You need to care about everything

00:06:11.969 --> 00:06:13.124
and it starts with yourself.

00:06:13.124 --> 00:06:14.657
Look yourself in the mirror

00:06:14.657 --> 00:06:17.263
and ask yourself, "What
do I want to do every day

00:06:17.263 --> 00:06:18.725
"For the rest of my life?"

00:06:18.725 --> 00:06:20.165
Do that.

00:06:20.165 --> 00:06:22.487
I promise you can monetize that (beep).

