00:07:02.649 --> 00:07:03.864
I really don't.

00:07:03.864 --> 00:07:04.703
I really, really don't.

00:07:04.703 --> 00:07:07.534
I don't care if you want
to buy the New York Jets.

00:07:07.534 --> 00:07:10.638
I don't care what you want or need.

00:07:10.638 --> 00:07:13.307
You need to care about
what you want and need.

00:07:13.307 --> 00:07:15.322
You can't worry about what I'm saying.

00:07:15.322 --> 00:07:16.699
You can't worry about whoever your

00:07:16.699 --> 00:07:18.291
flavor of the month is right?

00:07:18.291 --> 00:07:19.992
Maybe I'm your flavor
of the month right now.

00:07:19.992 --> 00:07:23.520
Maybe your consistent flavor of the life

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:25.126
