00:07:32.115 --> 00:07:34.527
You want to take the chance
of being an entrepreneur.

00:07:34.527 --> 00:07:36.607
Or the reverse, or the reverse.

00:07:36.607 --> 00:07:38.955
No one preaches and loves entrepreneurship

00:07:38.955 --> 00:07:39.788
more than me

00:07:39.788 --> 00:07:40.822
but I think you see me all the time

00:07:40.822 --> 00:07:43.114
