00:08:50.457 --> 00:08:52.378
Trying to climb those different
mountains in our lives.

00:08:52.378 --> 00:08:53.979
What makes you tick?

00:08:53.979 --> 00:08:55.406
That is all that matters.

00:08:55.406 --> 00:08:57.545
Don't do, you know I don't do DailyVee

00:08:57.545 --> 00:09:00.315
